Long-term follow-up of von Recklinghausen neurofibromatosis: survival and malignant neoplasms</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>1986</year><volume>314</volume><fpage>1010</fpage><lpage>1015</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'N Engl J Med||314|1010||bib17|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3083258</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Stiller</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Chessels</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Fitchett</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Neurofibromatosis and childhood leukaemia&#x0002f;lymphoma: a population-based UKCCSG study</article-title><source>Br J Cancer</source><year>1994</year><volume>70</volume><supplement>5</supplement><fpage>969</fpage><lpage>972</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Cancer||70|969||bib18|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7947106</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Viskochil</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Buchberg</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Xu</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Stevens</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Wolff</surname><given-names>RK</given-names></name><name><surname>Culver</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Carey</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Copland</surname><given-names>NG</given-names></name><name><surname>Jenkins</surname><given-names>NA</given-names></name><name><surname>White</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>O'Connell</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Deletions and translocations interrupt a cloned gene at the neurofibromatosis type 1 locus</article-title><source>Cell</source><year